        {
            "title": "李家超：將為本港青年推全新金融專題內地實習計劃",
            "description": "<div class=\"post-body\" id=\"gallery-lightbox\">\n\n<div class=\"videoStoryPlayer\">\n\n\n\n\n<iframe allow=\"autoplay\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" data-src=\"https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/video/202609/21/6ab0ec84e4b08c07fd19e3df/6c9c5f032e444228b35f8360479c1c8e.m3u8&amp;p=https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/image/202609/21/6ab0eeeee4b08c07fd19e5361.jpg\" data-videoid=\"AP6ab0f619e4b02724bdb52a60\" height=\"100%\" id=\"playVideoAP6ab0f619e4b02724bdb52a60\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"https://player.dotdotnews.com/video-player/player.html?src=https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/video/202609/21/6ab0ec84e4b08c07fd19e3df/6c9c5f032e444228b35f8360479c1c8e.m3u8&amp;p=https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/image/202609/21/6ab0eeeee4b08c07fd19e5361.jpg&amp;playerId=AP6ab0f619e4b02724bdb52a60\" width=\"100%\"></iframe>\n<script>\n          /*<![CDATA[*/\n          var contentType = $(\"#storyContentType\").val();\n          var liveStatus = $(\"#liveStatus\").val();\n          var bHeight = $(\"iframe\").width();\n          var liveUrl = $(\"#liveUrl\").val();\n          var livePlayUrl = 'https://player.dotdotnews.com/video-player/player.html?src=';\n          console.log(contentType, liveStatus);\n          var tubUrl = 'https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/image/202609/21/6ab0eeeee4b08c07fd19e5361.jpg';\n                        \n                         if (contentType == 3) {\n                         if (liveStatus == 1) {\n                         var iframeUrl = livePlayUrl + liveUrl + '&p=' + tubUrl + '&isLive=true' + '&playerId=' + $(\"#storyID\").val();\n                         $(\".mainManuscripts .videoStoryPlayer iframe,#sharePag .videoStoryPlayer iframe\").attr(\"src\", iframeUrl);\n                         } else if ((liveStatus == 2 && liveUrl == \"\") || liveStatus==0) {\n                         $(\".mainManuscripts .videoStoryPlayer,#sharePag .videoStoryPlayer\").css(\"display\", \"none\");\n                         }\n                         }\n                         /*]]>*/\n        </script>\n</div>\n<div class=\"storyContent\"><p>【點新聞報道】行政長官李家超今日（21日）在第七屆粵港澳大灣區傑出青年企業家頒獎典禮視像致辭表示，當局會繼續以《青年發展藍圖》為基礎，培育他們成為愛國愛港、具備世界視野、有抱負和正向思維的新一代，在社會上盡展所長。</p>\n<p>李家超指，粵港澳大灣區是青年施展才華的廣闊舞台。剛發表的施政報告提出多項措施，支持青年深度參與大灣區建設，更好融入和服務國家發展大局。除了繼續鼓勵青年在大灣區創業就業，當局會深化青年發展項目，包括推出全新金融專題內地實習計劃，支持青年在內地大型金融機構實習，同時舉辦航天專題內地培訓活動，以及增加中國科學院高端科研主題實習名額，鼓勵青年投身創科新興領域，開創更廣闊的事業版圖。</p>\n<p>李家超還表示，特區政府今年將成立國際青年人才交流基地，推廣國際交流，並提供到聯合國不同機構的實習崗位，讓香港青年在國際舞台發揮所長，說好中國故事、說好香港故事。</p>\n<p><strong>相關閱讀：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.dotdotnews.com/a/202609/18/AP6aad057ee4b02724bdb4e163.html\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #0000ff; font-weight: bold;\" target=\"_blank\"> 足本全片｜專訪李家超　特首金句逐個睇 </a></p></div>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.dotdotnews.com/a/202609/21/AP6ab0f619e4b02724bdb52a60.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-21 17:18:23",
            "source": "dotdotnews",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "淘寶宣布「雙11」港澳零門檻包郵　九成中大件海外直郵",
            "description": "<div class=\"post-body\" id=\"gallery-lightbox\">\n\n<div class=\"videoStoryPlayer\">\n\n\n\n\n<iframe allow=\"autoplay\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" data-src=\"https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/video/202603/21/69beb00ee4b08c07fcdcfbd5/7d82e14ff657445e827c8816907ce29a.m3u8&amp;p=https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/image/202609/21/6ab0e27ce4b08c07fd19e0211.jpg\" data-videoid=\"AP6ab0ea39e4b02724bdb52847\" height=\"100%\" id=\"playVideoAP6ab0ea39e4b02724bdb52847\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"https://player.dotdotnews.com/video-player/player.html?src=https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/video/202603/21/69beb00ee4b08c07fcdcfbd5/7d82e14ff657445e827c8816907ce29a.m3u8&amp;p=https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/image/202609/21/6ab0e27ce4b08c07fd19e0211.jpg&amp;playerId=AP6ab0ea39e4b02724bdb52847\" width=\"100%\"></iframe>\n<script>\n          /*<![CDATA[*/\n          var contentType = $(\"#storyContentType\").val();\n          var liveStatus = $(\"#liveStatus\").val();\n          var bHeight = $(\"iframe\").width();\n          var liveUrl = $(\"#liveUrl\").val();\n          var livePlayUrl = 'https://player.dotdotnews.com/video-player/player.html?src=';\n          console.log(contentType, liveStatus);\n          var tubUrl = 'https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/image/202609/21/6ab0e27ce4b08c07fd19e0211.jpg';\n                        \n                         if (contentType == 3) {\n                         if (liveStatus == 1) {\n                         var iframeUrl = livePlayUrl + liveUrl + '&p=' + tubUrl + '&isLive=true' + '&playerId=' + $(\"#storyID\").val();\n                         $(\".mainManuscripts .videoStoryPlayer iframe,#sharePag .videoStoryPlayer iframe\").attr(\"src\", iframeUrl);\n                         } else if ((liveStatus == 2 && liveUrl == \"\") || liveStatus==0) {\n                         $(\".mainManuscripts .videoStoryPlayer,#sharePag .videoStoryPlayer\").css(\"display\", \"none\");\n                         }\n                         }\n                         /*]]>*/\n        </script>\n</div>\n<div class=\"storyContent\"><p>【點新聞報道】阿里巴巴旗下淘寶公布，今年「雙11」海外活動將在全球20個市場同步啟動，超過120萬商家參與。13個國家和地區將提供包郵服務，其中香港、澳門、新加坡、馬來西亞實現「0門檻包郵」。出海商品也從輕小件拓展至傢具、家裝建材等中件、大件品類，90%以上中大件商品可實現海外直郵。</p>\n<p>據介紹，淘寶將在首頁新增海外流量入口，上線Discover頻道、海外榜單和清單。淘寶出海業務負責人葉天表示，平台將承擔跨境鏈路的複雜度，讓商家依託同一間店、同一批商品同時經營國內與海外市場。淘寶數據顯示，其出海業務GMV已連續6年實現雙位數增長，超過15萬商家出海後按年增長翻倍。</p></div>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.dotdotnews.com/a/202609/21/AP6ab0ea39e4b02724bdb52847.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-21 16:28:30",
