            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "央行9·23在港發行600億元中央銀行票據",
            "description": "<div class=\"post-body\" id=\"gallery-lightbox\">\n\n<div class=\"videoStoryPlayer\">\n\n\n\n\n<iframe allow=\"autoplay\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" data-src=\"https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/share/video/202609/21/69beb00ee4b08c07fcdcfbd5/7d82e14ff657445e827c8816907ce29a.m3u8&amp;p=https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/image/202609/21/6ab08e77e4b08c07fd19b42f1.jpg\" data-videoid=\"AP6ab09093e4b02724bdb51eb3\" height=\"100%\" id=\"playVideoAP6ab09093e4b02724bdb51eb3\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"https://player.dotdotnews.com/video-player/player.html?src=https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/share/video/202609/21/69beb00ee4b08c07fcdcfbd5/7d82e14ff657445e827c8816907ce29a.m3u8&amp;p=https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/image/202609/21/6ab08e77e4b08c07fd19b42f1.jpg&amp;playerId=AP6ab09093e4b02724bdb51eb3\" width=\"100%\"></iframe>\n<script>\n          /*<![CDATA[*/\n          var contentType = $(\"#storyContentType\").val();\n          var liveStatus = $(\"#liveStatus\").val();\n          var bHeight = $(\"iframe\").width();\n          var liveUrl = $(\"#liveUrl\").val();\n          var livePlayUrl = 'https://player.dotdotnews.com/video-player/player.html?src=';\n          console.log(contentType, liveStatus);\n          var tubUrl = 'https://dw-media.dotdotnews.com/dams/product/image/202609/21/6ab08e77e4b08c07fd19b42f1.jpg';\n                        \n                         if (contentType == 3) {\n                         if (liveStatus == 1) {\n                         var iframeUrl = livePlayUrl + liveUrl + '&p=' + tubUrl + '&isLive=true' + '&playerId=' + $(\"#storyID\").val();\n                         $(\".mainManuscripts .videoStoryPlayer iframe,#sharePag .videoStoryPlayer iframe\").attr(\"src\", iframeUrl);\n                         } else if ((liveStatus == 2 && liveUrl == \"\") || liveStatus==0) {\n                         $(\".mainManuscripts .videoStoryPlayer,#sharePag .videoStoryPlayer\").css(\"display\", \"none\");\n                         }\n                         }\n                         /*]]>*/\n        </script>\n</div>\n<div class=\"storyContent\"><p>【點新聞報道】據中國人民銀行公開市場業務操作室9月21日公告，為豐富香港高信用等級人民幣金融產品，完善香港人民幣收益率曲線，根據中國人民銀行與香港金融管理局簽署的《關於使用債務工具中央結算系統發行中國人民銀行票據的合作備忘錄》，2026年9月23日（周三）中國人民銀行將通過香港金融管理局債務工具中央結算系統（CMU）債券投標平台，招標發行2026年第九期中央銀行票據。</p>\n\n<p>中國人民銀行表示，本期票據期限182天，發行量600億元，面值100元，採用荷蘭式利率招標，起息日為9月28日，到期日順延至2027年3月29日，到期日遇節假日順延。</p></div>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.dotdotnews.com/a/202609/21/AP6ab09093e4b02724bdb51eb3.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-21 10:06:22",
